This will remove __PRODUCT_TITLE__ from this Mac.

Despite the button below reading "Install", nothing is installed. macOS does
not let an installer package rename that button, and this package is the way
Apple provides for removing software that placed files outside an application
folder.

The following are removed:

  - the print agent and its background jobs
  - the automatic updater, its cache and its state
  - the local certificate this Mac generated for the agent, and its trust entry
  - the agent's log files

Label printing from the browser will stop working on this Mac once this
finishes. Nothing on any printer is changed, and no printer is removed from
System Settings.

You will be asked for an administrator password.
